tance fails to satisfy any of the schemas listed under "anyOf".'}]}, {'group': 'AnyOfValidator - empty anyOf array', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'executionContext', 'value': 'mockExecutionContextEmptyAnyOf'}, {'parameter': 'node', 'value': 'jsonNode({"type":"null"})'}, {'parameter': 'rootNode', 'value': 'jsonNode({"type":"null"})'}, {'parameter': 'instanceLocation', 'value': 'JsonNodePath.root()'}], 'expected': 'Set<ValidationMessage> containing a message indicating that anyOf must contain at least one schema', 'description': "If the schema's anyOf array is empty, validation should fail immediately with a clear error message."}]}, {'group': 'AnyOfValidator - null node (instance is missing)', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'executionContext', 'value': 'mockExecutionContext'}, {'parameter': 'node', 'value': 'null'}, {'parameter': 'rootNode', 'value': 'jsonNode({"type":"object","properties":{}})'}, {'parameter': 'instanceLocation', 'value': 'JsonNodePath.root()'}], 'expected': 'Set<ValidationMessage> containing a message that the instance is missing and cannot be validated against anyOf', 'description': 'When the instance node is null, the validator should treat it as a validation failure unless the anyOf subschemas explicitly allow null.'}]}, {'group': 'AnyOfValidator - walk flag set to true (internal validation of subschemas)', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'executionContext', 'value': 'mockExecutionContextWalkTrue'}, {'parameter': 'node', 'value': 'jsonNode({"type":"object","properties":{"a":1}})'}, {'parameter': 'rootNode', 'value': 'jsonNode({"type":"object","properties":{"a":1}})'}, {'parameter': 'instanceLocation', 'value': 'JsonNodePath.root()'}], 'expected': 'empty Set<ValidationMessage> (walk succeeded)', 'description': 'The protected overload validate(..., boolean walk) is exercised via a subclass that exposes it. When walk is true the validator must recursively walk each subschema; this test ensures that a matching subschema still results in