tains a subschema that explicitly permits null, validation must succeed and return no errors.'}]}, {'group': 'AnyOfValidator - anyOf contains boolean true schema (always passes)', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'executionContext', 'value': 'mockExecutionContext'}, {'parameter': 'node', 'value': 'jsonNode({"type":"integer","value":42})'}, {'parameter': 'rootNode', 'value': 'jsonNode({"type":"integer","value":42})'}, {'parameter': 'instanceLocation', 'value': 'JsonNodePath.root()'}], 'expected': 'empty Set<ValidationMessage> (anyOf includes a true schema which validates any instance)', 'description': 'A boolean schema `true` inside anyOf should cause validation to succeed regardless of the other subschemas.'}]}, {'group': 'AnyOfValidator - anyOf contains boolean false schema (fails unless another subschema passes)', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'executionContext', 'value': 'mockExecutionContext'}, {'parameter': 'node', 'value': 'jsonNode({"type":"string","value":"foo"})'}, {'parameter': 'rootNode', 'value': 'jsonNode({"type":"string","value":"foo"})'}, {'parameter': 'instanceLocation', 'value': 'JsonNodePath.root()'}], 'expected': 'empty Set<ValidationMessage> (second subschema matches, first is false)', 'description': 'The anyOf array contains a `false` schema (which never matches) followed by a valid string schema. Validation must succeed because at least one subschema matches.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'executionContext', 'value': 'mockExecutionContext'}, {'parameter': 'node', 'value': 'jsonNode({"type":"number","value":3.14})'}, {'parameter': 'rootNode', 'value': 'jsonNode({"type":"number","value":3.14})'}, {'parameter': 'instanceLocation', 'value': 'JsonNodePath.root()'}], 'expected': 'Set<ValidationMessage> containing a single anyOf error (no subschema matches)', 'description': 'Both subschemas fail (first is false, second expects a string). The validator must return a single anyOf error, not two.'}]}, {'group': 'AnyOfValidator - anyOf contains empty